LOCATION:CineCycle
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/mayworks-festival-with-hasan-in-gaza-2025-scr
 eening-discussion-tickets-1986259452491\n\nHosted by Mayworks Festival
  (https://mayworks.ca)\n\nThis feature documentary explores Kamal
  Aljafari’s two-decade old camcorder footage depicting his search
